        "english": "Music Production: Texture Music\r\nComposer: Peilin Wu, Sherwin Yang, J. Meng\r\nOrchestrator: Peilin Wu, Sherwin Yang, J. Meng\r\n\r\nDizi, Xiao: Shih-Yu Liu\r\nErhu: Jian-Ying Wu\r\nSheng: Wei-Yun Wang\r\nPipa: Chiang Yu\r\nSuona: Po-Yu Huang\r\nGuan Zi: Yu-Ying Tseng\r\nAcoustic Guitar: Sherwin Yang, Ocean Tsai\r\nElectric Guitar: Sherwin Yang, Carnival\r\nViolin: Peilin Wu\r\n\r\nMain Recording Engineer: Jason Hsu, Wei-Kang Wang\r\nMain Recording Studio: YuChen Cinema Studio, HMP Studio, Fullight Music\r\nMixing Engineer: Chi-Yang Hsu, Peilin Wu, Sherwin Yang, J. Meng, Meng-Chien Yu\r\n\r\nAdministration: Peilin Wu, Wei-Ping Chen\r\nProduction Assistant: Yen-Jen Liang",
